 are"\, "type": "highlight"\, "id": "fe48d236-8cf1-452d-8a25-2958b5dd8be9" 
 } ] Expressions in Metal Exhibition July 23- Aug 29\, 2026 Opening Recepti
 on: Thursday\, July 23\, 5:30-7:30pm RSVP HERE In the Main Gallery\, Expre
 ssions in Metal brings together nine Northern California artists who treat
  metal not as a static material but as a living language. &nbsp\; Curated 
 by Vicky Kumpfer\, this exhibition highlights a range of contemporary prac
 tices rooted in metalwork. Some artists forge\, cast\, or weld\, honoring 
 the discipline’s long lineage of craftsmanship. Others push the material
  into unexpected territories\, experimenting with surface\, scale\, and fo
 rm. Across the exhibition\, metal is bent\, stretched\, pierced\, patinate
 d\, and even coaxed into gestures that contradict its reputation for hardn
 ess. Participating Artists: Ray Degischer\, James Ford Grant\, Byron B. Ki
 m\, Sean Paul Lorenz\, Michael McGinnis\, Monty Monty\, Martin Munson\, J.
  Nick Taylor\, Shoji Uemura Curator: Vicky Kumpfer&nbsp\; Related Events: 
 North Gallery: Thirty-Six Views of the Golden Gate Bridge: The Photography
  of Arthur Drooker A Conversation: Arthur Drooker and Richard Neill Expres
 sions in Metal Panel Discussion #block-14c48ea57b82ff028197 { --stroke-sty
 le: none\;--stroke-thickness: 6px\; } #block-14c48ea57b82ff028197 .sqs-htm
